config BR2_PACKAGE_BULKHEAD_AGENT
	bool "bulkhead-agent"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GO_TARGET_ARCH_SUPPORTS
	help
	  bulkhead minimal agent runtime: a bounded perceive->decide->act loop
	  that runs inside a bulkhead jail, does inference via the bulkhead
	  router, and acts through a small tool set — escalating to the TCB
	  broker (human-gated) when it needs more authority than its jail
	  grants. Pure Go (stdlib only), single static binary, outside the TCB.

	  https://github.com/mtclinton/bulkhead
